# forget.walk (order 1562): the clean-up of a bench M9's store. Every
# arrival out of the ring: the flagged ones in "Bench", and the ones order
# 1540's image wrote into real chats before the flag (a zero signature,
# words that start "bench arrival "), with the read marks of nothing else.
# The summary log is erased and the store rebuilt from the ring; the
# reader's own messages and marks stay. The walk opens no chat, so it runs
# on whatever home the board is joined to: this is how Lew's own M9 is
# cleaned after windows 11 to 15.
#
#   just m9-walk <rig> scripts/m9-walks/forget.walk <bench elf of 1562 or later>
#
# Read the VERDICT's forget step: flagged=, unflagged=, marks=, entries=.
# Then the list's dump, for the eye: no "Bench", no "bench arrival" in any
# chat's last line.
wait page=chats
bench forget
wait page=chats
dump after-forget
